      "text": "a WIDE dashed box = ONE partition   ·   the small numbered squares inside it = MESSAGES, numbered by offset (0, 1, 2, 3)\nan ARROW leaves the whole partition = that ENTIRE partition, and every message in it, is assigned to that one consumer",
