      "width": 258.72,
      "height": 68.75,
      "text": "orders partition 0 — every message in it —\ngoes to K1 AND to A1.\n\nDifferent groups -> both get all of them.\nSame group -> that could never happen.",
      "originalText": "orders partition 0 — every message in it —\ngoes to K1 AND to A1.\n\nDifferent groups -> both get all of them.\nSame group -> that could never happen.",
